   "en": "Toshiro Hazama (42). Occupation, lawyer.\nHazama has his own practice and lives freely.\nRecently, he has been suffering from a problem.\nHis shoulders ache and he can't think straight.\nThis is a book about a middle-aged man who notices the fraying edges of his body that he didn't care about before, and now works diligently to maintain his health...."
